  characterName: Leila Khouri
  promptText: Sister, the drought killed our sheep. The old fog nets could pull water
    from the mist, but they are outlawed here. Setting them risks arrest. Do I risk
    it?
  leftAnswer: Wait. Stay free and look for safer aid
  rightAnswer: Set the nets. Your children must eat today
